      "body": "\n# Keep the draft-only limit\n\nEm’s worked example keeps the autonomy cap at L1 for the send variant. A person edits and commits each output.[^send] In the baseline mandate, the caseworker commits the action.[^decision]\n\n[^send]: Variant where the agent sends its reply, Em’s public playbook.\n\n[^decision]: Mandate / Decision rights, Em’s public playbook.\n"
    },
