        "x-correspondence-iri": "urn:okf:ai-capability-governance:concept:evidence-brief"
      },
      "body": "\n# Prepare the evidence for review\n\nEm’s playbook calls for reassessment when new actions or permissions are introduced.[^reassessment] The pilot evidence brief asks for the changed mandate, results of draft-only and shadow-mode tests, unresolved issues, and the named local reviewer’s decision. This is an illustrative template. The bundle contains no local appointment, approval or real correspondence.\n\n[^reassessment]: Reassessment trigger for new actions, Em’s public playbook.\n"
    },
