      "body": "\n# Correspondence triage mandate\n\nEm’s composite example starts at **Tier 3 · Enhanced**.[^baseline] The agent classifies correspondence and drafts a suggested reply from approved templates.[^scope] A caseworker commits the action.[^decision] Sending and deciding cases are outside the mandate.[^exclusions]\n\n## Continue through the case\n\n- [Give the agent the send action](./send-variant.md)\n\n[^baseline]: Worked example opening, Em’s public playbook.\n\n[^scope]: Mandate / In scope, Em’s public playbook.\n\n[^decision]: Mandate / Decision rights, Em’s public playbook.\n\n[^exclusions]: Mandate / Explicitly out of scope, Em’s public playbook.\n"
    },
