        "x-correspondence-iri": "urn:okf:ai-capability-governance:concept:send-variant"
      },
      "body": "\n# Give the agent the send action\n\nIn Em’s published variant, the proposed change is to let the agent send the reply itself. Em treats the new effect as irreversible, moves the composite example to **Tier 4 · Critical**, sets the variant’s cap at **L1 · Draft only**, and requires shadow mode.[^send] This records the published outcome for the example.\n\n## Continue through the case\n\n- [Keep the draft-only limit](./draft-only.md)\n- [Test in shadow mode](./shadow-mode.md)\n- [Prepare the evidence for review](./evidence-brief.md)\n\n[^send]: Variant where the agent sends its reply, Em’s public playbook.\n"
    },
