      "body": "\n# Test in shadow mode\n\nEm’s worked send variant requires shadow mode.[^send] For this pilot, show the agent proposing replies for comparison with human handling while the send action is unavailable. Retain evidence of how the draft-only boundary and escalation worked. These are illustrative test ideas.\n\n[^send]: Variant where the agent sends its reply, Em’s public playbook.\n"
